   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Brihat Jataka",
   "bbox": [
    1202,
    194,
    1498,
    231
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "particular Navamsa in any sign is to multiply the sign in the",
   "bbox": [
    270,
    283,
    1498,
    340
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "longitude by 9, add the requisite number for the Navamsa and",
   "bbox": [
    270,
    332,
    1498,
    389
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "divide the result by 12. If it is more than 12, the remainder will",
   "bbox": [
    270,
    383,
    1495,
    440
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "be the sign belonging to Navamsa involved and the lord of the",
   "bbox": [
    269,
    436,
    1493,
    491
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Navamsa will be the lord of that sign.",
   "bbox": [
    266,
    487,
    1028,
    538
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Example: Find out the Navamsa lord of the",
   "bbox": [
    339,
    558,
    1493,
    613
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Longitude <math>5^s-14^o-0</math>. Multiply 5 by <math>9 = 45 + \\text{ digits}</math>",
   "bbox": [
    262,
    605,
    1492,
    664
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "representing the 5th Navamsa comprises of 14 degrees <math>= 5.45</math>",
   "bbox": [
    263,
    654,
    1491,
    716
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<math>+5 = 50 \\div 12</math> leave 2. Hence the Navamsa is Taurus and its",
   "bbox": [
    262,
    707,
    1491,
    763
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "lord Venus.",
   "bbox": [
    263,
    761,
    501,
    799
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Example: Find out the Navamsa Lagna when the Longi-",
   "bbox": [
    333,
    827,
    1486,
    887
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "tude of Lagna is <math>10^{\\circ} - 17^{\\circ} - 20</math>. Here <math>10 \\times 9 = 90 + 6</math> (for <math>17^{\\circ} - 20</math>)",
   "bbox": [
    260,
    877,
    1489,
    936
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<math>= 96 \\div 12</math> leaves 0 ie Pisces. Hence the Navamsa Lagna would",
   "bbox": [
    259,
    926,
    1489,
    987
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "be Pisces <math>(12)</math>.",
   "bbox": [
    261,
    986,
    547,
    1022
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Lords of Trimshamshas (1/30th of a sign)",
   "bbox": [
    256,
    1082,
    1327,
    1143
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "कुजरविजगुरुज्ञशुक्रभागा: पवनसमीरणकौर्पिजूकलेया:।",
   "bbox": [
    332,
    1161,
    1106,
    1224
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "अयुजि युजि तु भे विपर्ययस्थाः शशिभवनालिझषान्तमृक्षसन्धिः ।। 7 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    329,
    1228,
    1359,
    1292
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "In odd signs <math>(1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11)</math>, the lord of the first five",
   "bbox": [
    329,
    1321,
    1479,
    1377
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "degrees will be Mars, the next 5 degrees ie from 6 to 10 the lord",
   "bbox": [
    253,
    1372,
    1476,
    1426
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "will be Saturn. The next 8 degrees ie from 11 to 18 the lord will",
   "bbox": [
    253,
    1422,
    1475,
    1477
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "be Jupiter, of the next 7 ie 19 to 25 degrees the lord will be",
   "bbox": [
    252,
    1472,
    1473,
    1528
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Mercury and the last 5 degrees ie from 26 to 30 the lordship",
   "bbox": [
    250,
    1523,
    1473,
    1579
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "will go to Venus. In the case of the even signs (2, 4, 6, 8, 10 and",
   "bbox": [
    250,
    1572,
    1472,
    1631
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "12) the order is reversed ie the lord of the first five degrees will",
   "bbox": [
    252,
    1624,
    1473,
    1681
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "be Venus, of next 7 Mercury, of next 8 Jupiter, of next 5 Saturn",
   "bbox": [
    247,
    1677,
    1472,
    1730
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "and of the last 5 Mars. This is reflected in the table below:",
